* 全链冲击仿真：零点->校准->10ms 斜坡 R 10k->120k，含 ADC 128kSPS 采样
.inc models.inc
V1 ta 0 3.3
Rtop ta t 10k
Rb t 0 150k
Rsamp t s R={10k+110k*V(ctl)}
Vctl ctl 0 PWL(0 0 10.5m 0 20.5m 1 24m 1)
Rref t f 100k
Vk1 k1c 0 PWL(0 1 5m 1 5.01m 0 10.21m 0 10.22m 1)
S1 s x k1c 0 swNO
Vk2 k2c 0 PWL(0 1 7m 1 7.01m 0 10.2m 0 10.21m 1)
Bk2n k2n 0 V={1-V(k2c)}
S2 f x k2n 0 swNO
Vsen sensec 0 PWL(0 1 5m 1 5.01m 0 10.21m 0 10.22m 1)
Bsenn sensen 0 V={1-V(sensec)}
S3 s m sensec 0 swNO
S4 f m sensen 0 swNO
M1 x g b b nmosb
Rs b 0 150k
R1 vset ta 360k
R2 vset 0 200k
Cf vset 0 1n
M2 vset xd 0 0 nmosb
Rg xd 0 1meg
Vdis dis 0 PWL(0 0 5m 0 5.01m 1 7m 1 7.01m 0 10m 0 10.01m 1 10.41m 1 10.42m 0)
Bdis xd 0 V={3.3*V(dis)}
Cg g 0 1n
Xop vset b ta 0 g opa333t
XT1 t tp ta 0 tp opa388t
XM1 m mp ta 0 mp opa388t
XB1 b bp ta 0 bp opa388t
Rf0 tp a0p 1k
Cf0 a0p 0 10n
Rf1 mp a0n 1k
Cf1 a0n 0 10n
Rf2 bp a1p 1k
Cf2 a1p 0 10n
Rf3 0 a1n 1k
Cf3 a1n 0 10n
Rz0 a0p a0n 130k
Rz1 a1p a1n 130k
Bch0 ch0d 0 V={V(a0p)-V(a0n)+500u}
Bch1 ch1d 0 V={V(a1p)-V(a1n)+500u}
* ADC 采样保持 128kSPS (孔径 2us 近似 SigmaDelta 积分)
Vsh shclk 0 PULSE(0 1 0 10n 10n 2u 7.8125u)
Ssh0 ch0d sh0 shclk 0 swsh
Csh0 sh0 0 1p
Ssh1 ch1d sh1 shclk 0 swsh
Csh1 sh1 0 1p
Vzp zpulse 0 PULSE(0 1 6.5m 10n 10n 20u 1)
Sz ch0d d0 zpulse 0 swsh
Cd0 d0 0 10n
Vcp cpulse 0 PULSE(0 1 9.5m 10n 10n 20u 1)
Skc ch1d kc cpulse 0 swsh
Ckc kc 0 10n
Bkd kdin 0 V={V(ch0d)-V(d0)}
Skd kdin kd cpulse 0 swsh
Ckd kd 0 10n
Brout rout 0 V={100k*V(kc)/max(V(kd),1u)*max(V(sh0)-V(d0),1u)/max(V(sh1),1u)}
Brt rtrue 0 V={10k+110k*V(ctl)}
.tran 0 24m 0 0.2u
.options method=gear
.end
